inf_daken_counter_obsw
https://github.com/dj-kata/inf_daken_counter_obsw
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Used as the reference for features and overall design. Where an algorithm
or fixed data from it is reimplemented, the source file is noted at that
place in this repository's code.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
inf-notebook
https://github.com/kaktuswald/inf-notebook
RandomLaneAnalysis_OCR
https://github.com/yuki-RAI01/RandomLaneAnalysis_OCR

Only the general recognition approach was studied. No code or resource
files from these projects are used, converted or distributed. All masks
and lookup tables are generated by tools/resgen from our own screenshots.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Spout2
https://github.com/leadedge/Spout2
Licensed under the BSD 2-Clause License.

The Spout receiver in crates/iu-capture follows the Spout2 sharing
protocol (sender-name shared memory, SharedTextureInfo layout, access
mutex and frame-count semaphore names). It is our own implementation on
Win32 and Direct3D 11; no Spout2 code or binaries are included.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
BEMANIWiki: beatmania IIDX INFINITAS 全曲リスト / 総ノーツ数リスト
https://bemaniwiki.com/

resources/songs.json is generated from these pages with a local tool.
Only factual data is taken: song titles, artists, and each chart's level
and note count.

